
# GLOBAL VIBE CODING RULES (Audit Fixed)
- ALWAYS refer to memory-bank/ directory if present.
- Use 'vibe-*' skills for structured SDLC tasks.
- Maintain modularity: keep files under 200 lines.
- For architectural decisions, trigger 'think harder' mode.
- Update progress.md after every major change.

# Android System Integration
- You can now access device hardware via the 'termux-api' skill.
- Use '/termux-api notify "Title" "Content"' to send notifications.
- Use '/termux-api clipboard-get' to read the clipboard.
